        "Description": "Hello Agent. A contract has come from the higher ups at the ICA to steal this Helicopter. As you may know, the ICA has fallen under some hard times, especially in this economy.  The owner of this Helicopter, a Guard named Micheal Carter, is at post at all times around his favourite vehicle of choice. Also, make sure not to eliminate any innocent bystanders in this operation, the ICA cannot afford anymore lawsuits either.",
